From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:50:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] 1298 redfin: Auto-Brightness fast wake ALS repost & True Tone color ALS

- SweetHIDALS (kern.sweet_bl_fix & 16, default on): cache last real sensd ALS
  sample and re-post within 15 ms on ReportInterval 0 -> >0 transitions (and
  20 ms on open at cold boot), beating CoreBrightness's 250 ms FirstALSSampleTimeout
  and eliminating the 435-nit wake flash.
- SweetHIDALS + AppleARMBacklight (kern.sweet_bl_fix & 32, default on): publish
  crgb=1, ALSSensorType=8, Placement=0, Orientation=1 on SweetHIDALS and
  default-whitepoint-type / truetone-strength on AppleARMBacklight; convert
  TCS3701 RGB (or CCT) into kIOHIDEventColorSpaceXYZ + CIE XYZ * pi components
  + ColorTemperature + fractional Illuminance in pure integer math (no FP).
- Runtime white-balance knobs: poke m knob alswr/alswg/alswb.
---
